h Schiffman\, Richard Perez & Adrien Pellerin. *Lineup subject to change. D
 
oor Time: 6pm. Show Time: 7pm. Front bar opens 1 hour prior to the door tim
 
e. 21 & over w/ valid\, government-issued photo ID. General Admission stand
 
ing & seating. Seating is 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive earl
 
y for best selection. If you have an accessibility request\, please email t
 
hebellhouse@livenation.com prior. No outside food\, drink permitted. $.25 p
 
er each ticket sold for a majority of events at The Bell House benefits Com
 
edy Gives Back\, a safety net for the comedy community. IG: @comedygivesbac
 
